---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    primaryColor: "#F4EFE7"
    primaryTextColor: "#24221E"
    primaryBorderColor: "#C9BDAE"
    lineColor: "#706A61"
---
flowchart TD
    Start([Intro]) --> Begin[Start the 48-item flow]
    Begin --> Question[Render current layer and question]
    Question --> Answer{Response selected?}
    Answer -->|No| Stay[Keep current question and explain required response]
    Stay --> Question
    Answer -->|Yes| Last{Last item?}
    Last -->|No| More[Advance and preserve answer]
    More --> Transition{Layer boundary?}
    Transition -->|Yes| Notice[Show next-layer orientation notice]
    Notice --> Question
    Transition -->|No| Question
    Last -->|Yes| Calculate[[Calculate layer profiles and coverage]]
    Calculate --> Results([Render results])
